<title>USA: Action Products Q1 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Action Products Q1 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>OCALA, Fla. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months ended</p>
<p>					    Mar 31, 1997	 and 1996</p>
<p> Sales					 1,144,386	1,437,664</p>
<p> Gross profit				  476,233	  521,857</p>
<p> Gross profit margin			   41.6%	    36.3%</p>
<p> Net Income  (loss)			 (63,734)	  128,780</p>
<p> Net Income (loss) per share		(0.04)	     0.09</p>
<p> Weighted Avg. # shares		  1,549,926	1,499,926</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Action Products International Inc.</p>
